== Ways to boost XP gain ==
{{Main|Mining Wisdom}}
The amount of Mining XP the player receives can be increased through the {{stat|mining wisdom}} stat. The maximum possible [[Mining Wisdom]] that can be achieved is displayed below.

* {{NPCSprite|Candidate Jerry}} [<nowiki/>{{NPCSprite|Cole}}]
* [[File:Iron Pickaxe.png|20px|link=Mining Fiesta]] [[Mining Fiesta]]
* {{Item|Silverfish Pet|rarity=l}} [{{Lv|100}}]
* {{Item|Divan's Drill}} [<nowiki/>{{Item|Andesite Whetstone|text=Refined}} + {{Item|Recombobulator 3000}} + {{Ench|Compact X}}]
* {{Item|Booster Cookie}}
* {{Item|Mining XP Boost Potion|text=Mining XP Boost III}}
* {{Item|Heart of the Mountain|text=Seasoned Mineman 101}}
* {{Item|Actually Blue™ Abicase}}

== Mining Levels ==
=== Leveling Rewards ===
As any [[Skill]], '''Mining''' requires Experience to be leveled. A total of {{Green|3,022,425}}, {{Green|55,172,425}} and {{skill XP|111,672,425 [[Mining]]}} is required to reach {{Skill|Mining 25}}, {{Skill|Mining 50}} and {{Skill|Mining 60}} respectively.
{{/Skill UI}}
{{/Leveling Rewards}}

=== Item Abilities ===
Abilities of some items gain a bonus depending on player's '''Mining''' level
{{stub}}
*{{Item|Ammonite Pet}}'s {{AN|Gift of the Ammonite}} grants {{stat|FS|0.5}}, {{stat|spd|2}} and {{stat|def|2}} per '''Mining''' and [[Fishing]] level.
*{{Item|Glacite Armor}}'s full set bonus — {{AN|Expert Miner}} — grants {{stat|MnS|2}} per '''Mining level'''.

